arguments.command:
cat << 'EOF' > /app/poster.html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

  :root {
    --bg-color: #0d1321;
    --text-main: #f8f9fa;
    --text-muted: #adb5bd;
    --accent-red: #e63946;
    --accent-gold: #f4a261;
    --accent-blue: #457b9d;
    --card-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 100px 120px;
    width: 2400px;
    height: 3394px;
    background-color: var(--bg-color);
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 15%, rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.15) 0%, transparent 60%);
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  h1, h2, h3, h4, .number {
    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* Header Section */
  .header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }
  .header h1 {
    font-size: 90px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .header .subtitle {
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 1800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .header .subtitle span {
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* Hero / Dominant Metric */
  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 100px;
    padding: 80px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(230,57,70,0.1) 0%, rgba(230,57,70,0) 100%);
    border-radius: 40px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.3);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(230,57,70,0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-number {
    font-size: 380px;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff7b00, #e63946);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    margin-bottom: -20px;
    letter-spacing: -8px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .hero-text {
    font-size: 110px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--text-main);
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .hero-subtext {
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .hero-subtext span {
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* Main Grid Content */
  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .panel {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 30px;
    padding: 70px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .panel-title {
    font-size: 55px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    border-bottom: 3px solid rgba(244, 162, 97, 0.3);
    padding-bottom: 25px;
  }

  /* Progress Map Section */
  .map-container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }
  .globe-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .globe {
    width: 320px;
    height: 320px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 4px solid var(--border-color);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #1d3557;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
  }
  .globe.historic::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 50%;
    background: rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.75);
  }
  .globe.current::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 27%;
    background: rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.75);
  }
  .globe-label {
    font-size: 65px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .globe-subtext {
    font-size: 32px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .panel-desc {
    font-size: 36px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .panel-desc strong {
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  /* Chart Section */
  .chart-container {
    width: 100%;
    height: 500px;
    margin-top: 30px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .chart-y-labels {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 60px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 28px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .chart-x-labels {
    position: absolute;
    left: 120px; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 32px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .svg-chart {
    position: absolute;
    left: 120px;
    top: 20px;
    width: calc(100% - 120px);
    height: calc(100% - 80px);
  }
  .trend-desc {
    font-size: 34px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 50px;
  }

  /* Bottom Grid */
  .bottom-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 80px;
  }

  /* Burden Stats */
  .stat-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border-left: 8px solid var(--accent-red);
  }
  .stat-value {
    font-size: 65px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--accent-red);
    width: 350px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .stat-desc {
    font-size: 36px;
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .stat-desc span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 26px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  /* Interventions */
  .interventions-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .intervention-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 40px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  }
  .icon-circle {
    width: 120px;
    height: 120px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(244, 162, 97, 0.15);
    border: 3px solid var(--accent-gold);
    margin: 0 auto 30px auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 50px;
  }
  .intervention-card h4 {
    font-size: 32px;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .intervention-card p {
    font-size: 26px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Footer / Call to action */
  .footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 60px;
    padding-top: 50px;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--border-color);
  }
  .footer p {
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }
  .footer p span {
    color: var(--accent-red);
    font-weight: 800;
  }

</style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="header">
    <h1>MALARIA: A PREVENTABLE KILLER</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">
      Over half a million people still die from malaria each year—most of them children—<br>
      yet humanity has made <span>remarkable progress</span> eliminating the disease from half the world.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero Anchor -->
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-number">1,320</div>
    <div class="hero-text">CHILDREN EVERY DAY</div>
    <div class="hero-subtext">lose their lives to a disease we <span>know how to prevent and treat.</span></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Content 2-Col -->
  <div class="content-grid">

    <!-- Left: Historical Progress -->
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="panel-title">FROM HALF THE WORLD TO A QUARTER</div>
      <p class="panel-desc">
        Malaria is not inherently a tropical disease. In the 1900s, it was endemic across vast stretches of the globe, including Europe and North America. Through public health campaigns and land use changes, it was eliminated in wealthier nations.
      </p>

      <div class="map-container">
        <div class="globe-wrapper">
          <div class="globe historic"></div>
          <div class="globe-label">~50%</div>
          <div class="globe-subtext">Historical Land<br>Coverage (~1900)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="globe-wrapper">
          <div class="globe current"></div>
          <div class="globe-label">~27%</div>
          <div class="globe-subtext">Coverage by 2002<br>(Reduced by nearly half)</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="panel-desc" style="margin-top: 20px;">
        The shrinking of the malaria map proves that <strong>elimination is possible</strong>. The challenge now is extending that success to the regions that need it most.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: Death Trends -->
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="panel-title">DEATH TOLL TRENDS: 2000–2023</div>

      <div class="chart-container">
        <div class="chart-y-labels">
          <span>1,000,000</span>
          <span>800,000</span>
          <span>600,000</span>
          <span>400,000</span>
        </div>

        <svg class="svg-chart" viewBox="0 0 700 400" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <!-- Grid lines -->
          <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="700" y2="0" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.1)" stroke-width="2"/>
          <line x1="0" y1="133.3" x2="700" y2="133.3" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.1)" stroke-width="2"/>
          <line x1="0" y1="266.6" x2="700" y2="266.6" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.1)" stroke-width="2"/>
          <line x1="0" y1="400" x2="700" y2="400" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.1)" stroke-width="2"/>

          <!-- Data Line (WHO Estimates roughly) -->
          <!-- 1M = 0, 400k = 400 => Y = (1,000,000 - value) / 1500 -->
          <!-- 2000(0): ~900k -> Y: 66.6 -->
          <!-- 2010(304): ~700k -> Y: 200 -->
          <!-- 2015(456): ~550k -> Y: 300 -->
          <!-- 2019(578): ~570k -> Y: 286 -->
          <!-- 2020(608): ~625k -> Y: 250 -->
          <!-- 2023(700): ~608k -> Y: 261 -->

          <!-- Glow filter -->
          <defs>
            <filter id="glow">
              <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="5" result="coloredBlur"/>
              <feMerge>
                <feMergeNode in="coloredBlur"/>
                <feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic"/>
              </feMerge>
            </filter>
          </defs>

          <path d="M 0 66.6 L 304 200 L 456 300 L 578 286 L 608 250 L 700 261" 
                fill="none" stroke="var(--accent-red)" stroke-width="8" filter="url(#glow)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>

          <!-- Data points -->
          <circle cx="0" cy="66.6" r="8" fill="#fff"/>
          <circle cx="456" cy="300" r="8" fill="#fff"/>
          <circle cx="608" cy="250" r="8" fill="#fff"/>
          <circle cx="700" cy="261" r="8" fill="#fff"/>

          <!-- Annotations -->
          <text x="440" y="340" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="22" font-family="Inter" font-weight="600">Progress Stalls</text>
          <line x1="456" y1="315" x2="456" y2="335" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="2" />

          <text x="500" y="210" fill="var(--accent-red)" font-size="22" font-family="Inter" font-weight="700">COVID-19 Setback</text>
          <line x1="608" y1="235" x2="580" y2="215" stroke="var(--accent-red)" stroke-width="2" />
        </svg>

        <div class="chart-x-labels">
          <span>2000</span>
          <span>2010</span>
          <span>2015</span>
          <span>2020</span>
          <span>2023</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="trend-desc">
        Following steady declines between 2000 and 2015, progress has stalled. Disruptions during the 2020 pandemic caused a sharp resurgence in deaths. (Note: IHME data suggests an even broader peak in the late 1990s).
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Bottom Content 2-Col -->
  <div class="bottom-grid">

    <!-- Burden -->
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="panel-title">THE BURDEN</div>

      <div class="stat-row">
        <div class="stat-value">>500k</div>
        <div class="stat-desc">
          Annual Deaths
          <span>During the 2010s average.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-row">
        <div class="stat-value">Africa</div>
        <div class="stat-desc">
          Most Affected Region
          <span>Bears the overwhelming majority of global deaths.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-row">
        <div class="stat-value">Under 5</div>
        <div class="stat-desc">
          Most Vulnerable Group
          <span>Children under five account for the highest share of mortality.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Interventions -->
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="panel-title">WHAT WORKS: TOOLS TO BEAT MALARIA</div>
      <p class="panel-desc">
        The same interventions that eliminated malaria from wealthy regions can be scaled in endemic areas to save millions of lives.
      </p>

      <div class="interventions-grid">
        <div class="intervention-card">
          <div class="icon-circle">🕸️</div>
          <h4>Insecticide Bednets</h4>
          <p>One of the most cost-effective tools globally, preventing fatal mosquito bites during sleep.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="intervention-card">
          <div class="icon-circle">💉</div>
          <h4>Vaccines &amp; Health</h4>
          <p>New malaria vaccines offer a promising additional layer of protection for young children.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="intervention-card">
          <div class="icon-circle">🏗️</div>
          <h4>Economic Development</h4>
          <p>Improved infrastructure, better housing, and healthcare access drastically reduce transmission.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>Every day that passes without action, <span>1,320 children</span> lose their lives. The world has proven elimination is possible—continued investment is the key.</p>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
EOF
